<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Activate Your Account</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
      .email-wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; }
      .email-header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; }
      .email-header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; }
      .email-header p { color: #94a3b8; margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
      .email-body { padding: 40px 30px; }
      .email-body p { color: #334155; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .activation-code { background: #f1f5f9; border: 2px dashed #38bdf8; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; margin: 24px 0; }
      .activation-code h2 { color: #0f172a; font-size: 36px; letter-spacing: 8px; margin: 0; font-weight: 800; }
      .activation-code p { color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; margin: 8px 0 0; }
      .email-footer { background: #f8fafc; padding: 20px 30px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
      .email-footer p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px; margin: 0; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
      <div class="email-header">
        <h1>Welcome to LMS</h1>
        <p>Start your learning journey today</p>
      </div>
      <div class="email-body">
        <p>Hello <strong><%= user.name %></strong>,</p>
        <p>Thank you for registering with QSP LEARNING. To activate your account, please use the following verification code:</p>
        <div class="activation-code">
          <h2><%= activationCode %></h2>
          <p>This code is valid for 5 minutes only</p>
        </div>
        <p>If you did not create this account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="email-footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 QSP LEARNING. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
